'''Liberty Shoes''' is an Indian [[Multinational corporation|multinational]] [[footwear]] company, based in [[Karnal]], [[Haryana]]. Founded in 1954, the company operates multi-brand outlets and showrooms in India, with 50 showrooms located outside India.<ref>{{cite news |title=For life 'n Liberty |url=http://www.thehindubusinessline.com/catalyst/2008/06/19/stories/2008061950110300.htm |work= [[Business Line]]|location=Chennai|date=19 June 2008 }}</ref> 

Liberty has six manufacturing facilities–two in [[Gharaunda]] and Liberty Puram (Haryana), where its primary and the largest manufacturing units are situated, [[Paonta Sahib]], ([[Himachal Pradesh]]), and two in [[Roorkee]] ([[Uttarakhand]]).<ref>{{cite web |title=Liberty Shoes to set up three units  |url= http://www.hindu.com/2006/03/28/stories/2006032809861600.htm|archive-url= https://web.archive.org/web/20071228070441/http://www.hindu.com/2006/03/28/stories/2006032809861600.htm|url-status= dead|archive-date= 28 December 2007|date=28 March 2006 |work=[[The Hindu]]  }}</ref>

